{
    "title": "Ultimate Clash Soccer",
    "description": "Bring together the magic of building a football team of collectable FIFPRO\u2122 licensed players, including Rafael Le\u00e3o and Ederson with the excitement of live pvp, multiplayer action! Play Ultimate Clash Soccer and get ready for a fun, easy to play football game where your strategy and gameplay skills combine perfectly in stunning graphics.\r\n\r\nUltimate Clash Soccer, a new football game from the award winning team at First Touch Games.\r\n\r\nSEASONAL FRESH CONTENT\r\n\u2022\tCollect seasonally refreshed real players officially licensed from FIFPRO\u2122.  \r\n\u2022\tVisit different cities and destinations each season! Win exciting events for unique prizes!\r\n\u2022\tUnique statistics and attributes assigned to each player based on true abilities and traits.\r\n\u2022\tMaster team selection choices.  Rotate your team and upgrade your players.  Fine tune with strategic tactics and team harmony!\r\n\u2022\tChoose your formation and roles. Then play!\r\n\r\nNEW TRANSFER MARKET!!\r\n\u2022\tKeep an eye out for favourite players available on the constantly refreshed transfer market!\r\n\r\nREALISTIC, HIGH ENERGY 3D GAMEPLAY\r\n\u2022\tKick-off an action-packed, adrenaline-filled 90 second match.   \r\n\u2022\tChoose players to make runs off the ball, craft beautiful passes and hit spectacular goals through simple finger-swiping controls, backed by sophisticated AI and animations.  \r\n\u2022\tAnticipate your defender movement and master tackle timing.    \r\n\u2022\tKeep cool in penalties and shoot outs.  Every match must have winner!\r\n\r\nCELEBRATE SUCCESS\r\n\u2022\tSoar up through the ranks as you win.  \r\n\u2022\tAchieve personal milestones, objectives and celebrate your well-deserved rewards and trophies. Show them off in personal and global leaderboards for everyone to see!\r\n\u2022\tChallenge your friends in nail biting 1 on 1 matches, to see who will rank top!\r\n\r\nCOLLECT AND CUSTOMISE\r\n\u2022\tCollect exquisitely designed kits and unique crests.  Dress to impress!\r\n\u2022\tShare reactions through fun emojis.\r\n\u2022\tGive your team real personality with your very own mascot!\r\n\r\n* Please note: This game is free to play, but additional content and in-game items may be purchased for real money. Certain content items are offered in a randomised order based on displayed drop rates. To disable In-App Purchases, go to Play Store/Settings/Authentication. \r\n\r\n* This game requires an internet connection and contains third party advertising.\r\n\r\nVISIT US: firsttouchgames.com\r\nLIKE US:  facebook.com/ultimateclashsoccer\r\nFOLLOW US:  instagram.com/ultimateclashsoccer\r\nWATCH US:  tiktok.com/@ultimateclashsoccer.ftg",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bring together the magic of building a football team of collectable FIFPRO\u2122 licensed players, including Rafael Le\u00e3o and Ederson with the excitement of live pvp, multiplayer action! Play Ultimate Clash Soccer and get ready for a fun, easy to play football game where your strategy and gameplay skills combine perfectly in stunning graphics.<br><br>Ultimate Clash Soccer, a new football game from the award winning team at First Touch Games.<br><br>SEASONAL FRESH CONTENT<br>\u2022\tCollect seasonally refreshed real players officially licensed from FIFPRO\u2122.  <br>\u2022\tVisit different cities and destinations each season! Win exciting events for unique prizes!<br>\u2022\tUnique statistics and attributes assigned to each player based on true abilities and traits.<br>\u2022\tMaster team selection choices.  Rotate your team and upgrade your players.  Fine tune with strategic tactics and team harmony!<br>\u2022\tChoose your formation and roles. Then play!<br><br>NEW TRANSFER MARKET!!<br>\u2022\tKeep an eye out for favourite players available on the constantly refreshed transfer market!<br><br>REALISTIC, HIGH ENERGY 3D GAMEPLAY<br>\u2022\tKick-off an action-packed, adrenaline-filled 90 second match.   <br>\u2022\tChoose players to make runs off the ball, craft beautiful passes and hit spectacular goals through simple finger-swiping controls, backed by sophisticated AI and animations.  <br>\u2022\tAnticipate your defender movement and master tackle timing.    <br>\u2022\tKeep cool in penalties and shoot outs.  Every match must have winner!<br><br>CELEBRATE SUCCESS<br>\u2022\tSoar up through the ranks as you win.  <br>\u2022\tAchieve personal milestones, objectives and celebrate your well-deserved rewards and trophies. Show them off in personal and global leaderboards for everyone to see!<br>\u2022\tChallenge your friends in nail biting 1 on 1 matches, to see who will rank top!<br><br>COLLECT AND CUSTOMISE<br>\u2022\tCollect exquisitely designed kits and unique crests.  Dress to impress!<br>\u2022\tShare reactions through fun emojis.<br>\u2022\tGive your team real personality with your very own mascot!<br><br>* Please note: This game is free to play, but additional content and in-game items may be purchased for real money. Certain content items are offered in a randomised order based on displayed drop rates. To disable In-App Purchases, go to Play Store/Settings/Authentication. <br><br>* This game requires an internet connection and contains third party advertising.<br><br>VISIT US: firsttouchgames.com<br>LIKE US:  facebook.com/ultimateclashsoccer<br>FOLLOW US:  instagram.com/ultimateclashsoccer<br>WATCH US:  tiktok.com/@ultimateclashsoccer.ftg",
